t’s a proud predator. Deer’s strong and speedy. Fox has a nose for trouble. Shy Mole’s an expert digger, and Dragonfly’s always buzzing.\n\nRanger Rae is the leader and can understand animals. And twelve-year-old Apprentice Roxy dreams of becoming a real Ranger and being able to talk to wildlife, too.\n\nIn each story, the Wildlifers go on a curious case. They travel to different places in the natural world, from coastlines and remote islands to forests and city streets, and meet a host of weird and wonderful creatures along the way.\n\nRanger Rae and the Wildlifers is a podcast from the National Trust, produced by Fun Kids Radio. \n\nArtwork (c) Becka Moor.\n\nHead to the National Trust Kids’ Podcast website: nationaltrust.org.uk/kids-podcast\n\nParents and guardians, please share your feedback at [REDACTED]","abridged":false,"accents":[],"copyrights":[],"narrators":[],"authors":["Ranger Rae and the Wildlifers | National Trust Kids' Podcast"],"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/IjvqyaWadjs-hki-mPYONYX_ZvF3dr9T9U6CSYRLuB8"},"media":{"duration":0,"fileSize":0}},"cardId":"aLdHS","createdAt":"2024-12-05T14:04:48.287Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-29T10:28:54.594Z","lastCheckedAt":"2026-11-01T04:08:33.908Z","availability":"free"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":true,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}